OL,3,GNEWSAReform's Dan Thomas quits as Welsh
OL,4,Aleader
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's leader Dan Thomas has quit
OL,7,Fas the party's Welsh leader, after he
OL,8,Fsaid he was "reported to the police".
OL,10,FIn a statement issued by his party, he
OL,11,Fsaid he was "standing down" from his
OL,12,Fposition due to personal reasons.
OL,14,FThomas was appointed Welsh party leader
OL,15,Fby Nigel Farage in February.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
