OL,3,GNEWSAReform's Dan Thomas quits as Welsh
OL,4,Aleader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas said: "Over the weekend, I was
OL,7,Freported to the police and was released
OL,8,Fwithout charge. I stress that I have
OL,9,Fdone nothing wrong, but I do not want
OL,10,Fthe coming headlines to be a
OL,11,Fdistraction from the fantastic work our
OL,12,FSenedd team is doing in holding this
OL,13,Fgovernment to account."
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
